name gregoriotex
category Package
revision 58331
shortdesc Engraving Gregorian Chant scores
longdesc Gregorio is a software application for engraving Gregorian
longdesc Chant scores on a computer. Gregorio's main job is to convert a
longdesc gabc file (simple text representation of a score) into a
longdesc GregorioTeX file, which makes TeX able to create a PDF of your
longdesc score.
depend gregoriotex.ARCH
